// # Catalog CI Workflows
//
// Logline: File-tree gate, auto-release on push to main, Pages deploy.
//
// Setup: Structural. YAML consumed by GitHub Actions. No OODA_COMPILER
//        on the runner. Local scripts still use OODA_COMPILER.
//
// Beats:
//   1. ci.yml catalog-gate checks catalog, CNAME, packages, no VERSION.
//   2. auto-release runs only after the gate.
//   3. deploy.yml uploads this tree as GitHub Pages.

// ci.yml and deploy.yml are YAML. Not imported.
